# 换行符统一：入库一律 LF，检出按平台（Windows 转 CRLF）
# 背景：迁移包在打包时被转成 CRLF，而原仓库是 LF，导致两边 67 个文件"内容不同"
# 实为换行差异。立此规则后，换行不再进 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资产：不参与换行转换，也不做 diff
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
